Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:07.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:18.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:23.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:27.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:34.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:41.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:49.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:55.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:59.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:03.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:10.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:21.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我回家去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了没 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.10,0:01:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:53.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快回去回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们每次回来 这里的时候就只会吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:01:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 让她走掉行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关我啥事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 犬夜叉那个大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是因为担心他的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会阻止打斗的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打消念头嘛 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉吃醋不是家常便饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的心胸太狭窄了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会把钢牙的蠢话当真
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他是个对自己 毫无自信的可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也代表着他是真的喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:48.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:51.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是回去拿些药跟绷带
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:56.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过对犬夜叉要保密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也该让他担心一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要快点回来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:15.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第47话 奈落残留的鬼蜘蛛灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落…有何贵干
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉这么敏锐 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且不只今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不下数次 来查探我的情况了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像很在意我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你会在意我 也是身不由己的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在你心中 鬼蜘蛛的心还强烈的残存着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要先用餐 还是先洗澡？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先洗澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.49,0:04:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你这么累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈现在就去准备
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了 行李放下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:05:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不像是母亲和女儿的对话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是在外地就职的 上班族与妻子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 这次要待几天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡个觉就要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 草太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把绷带跟外伤药拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是床最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:30.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让他稍微担心一下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你会在意我 也是身不由己的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:06:00.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在你心中 鬼蜘蛛的心还强烈的残存着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明随时都可以杀了那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会下不了手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是因为我奈落的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还残留着对桔梗朝思暮想的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个卑微的盗贼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使身体无法动弹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对桔梗的非分之想却与日俱增
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后将身体献给众多的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而诞生出我奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那愚蠢人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对桔梗朝思暮想的心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还残留在我奈落的身体里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你真是太轻视我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我奈落不是鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在四魂之玉 已大致到手的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心也等于无了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那团乌云是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刚才就停在寺院上面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像很不吉利耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些光是…死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在吞噬着死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:23.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.97,0:08:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是奈落所做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘 您要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 马借我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙打算吞尽 这块土地所有的死魂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能让他得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 死魂被抽出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 伤口的情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会痛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是拜珊瑚 你们的照顾所赐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 奈落还有着 各式各样的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指兽郎丸和影郎丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的…第四个分身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟兽郎丸 只拥有战斗的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落的命令都不服从
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算那只是傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却毫不犹豫砍下 己方奈落的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落都难以掌控的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜伏在兽郎丸肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:44.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伺机攻击的哥哥影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:45.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样非常残忍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是完全不知底细的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今后不知会出现怎样的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往后非得要更加谨慎小心了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不打算 去接戈薇姑娘回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不在我还乐的清静咧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你不要把气氛 搞的这么烦躁嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:12.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很累人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真耐得住性子跟犬夜叉交往
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我深表认同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:28.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是回去拿些药跟绷带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过对犬夜叉要保密喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也该让他担心一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:39.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经和戈薇约定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是别说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大致上 怎么看 都是钢牙的单相思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不用提心吊胆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闷不做声而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像全部都是我的错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会道歉咧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇那个大浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是不快点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不就变成大坏蛋了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:23.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底做了什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真的生气了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:46.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巨大的死魂虫？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:51.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:56.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好严重的伤 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的毒蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是奈落搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算解决桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不允许这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎能让奈落杀害桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 我马上解决怪虫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这边静静等我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大怪虫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碰上我算你倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有死魂 你就无法存活了吗…桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.79,0:15:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 你会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才要问你呢 你怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被妖怪赶来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以来这里找我帮忙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少自负了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不知不觉中逃到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经晚上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不把我叫起来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还没睡醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 你在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得 我们和五十年前一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从将你封印在此开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经就变了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们因奈落的陷阱而彼此憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.81,0:16:34.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被封印在 这棵树的五十年之间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 那么是我变了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我知道奈落 那家伙的存在之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确曾经恨过你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:53.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你不是也说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的命是属于你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你的命…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:02.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是属于我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追根究底 你也和奈落一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和奈落一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实残留着鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个盗贼一直 希望我成为他的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特地指使我亲手除掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:34.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是受盗贼鬼蜘蛛 强烈的嫉妒心驱使
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫉妒…为了那么一点小事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就这么点小事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而…这就是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:49.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的体内 还残留着鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说奈落对你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本不想承认
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我似乎还残留着思念这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了否定这种念头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才想要我消失的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的体内已充满了死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算一个人消灭奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那奈落居然迷恋着你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶心至极
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:37.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经这么晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的脑袋也该冷静了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉跟桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在的这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在怎么想都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但怎能将你交给奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能从奈落手中保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我而已不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么疯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:22.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不需要再战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就由我来保护
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人真是愚蠢的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为紧紧抱着 女人就是自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到现在的你就更能了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要奈落仍有鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必定能趁虚而入
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时正是净化奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他从世上完全消失掉的时机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾纠缠在一起的命运之线
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经无法复元了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫉妒？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是鬼蜘蛛那龌龊人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个光是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:24.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐在这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…你看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…他一直注视着我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:21:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何…你目不转睛的盯着我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:30.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:41.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:49.32,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.30,0:22:52.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:57.34,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.81,0:23:04.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:12.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:19.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:27.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:34.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下定决心保护桔梗的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.97,0:23:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经无法留在他身边了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.53,0:23:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么想的我 再度逃回了现代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.74,0:23:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是四魂碎片还在我手上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.27,0:24:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此非得回战国时代才行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.51,0:24:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是还给犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切就真的结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦恼的我 站在第一次 遇见犬夜叉的神木之前
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.05,0:24:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.55,0:24:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想回到相遇的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.69,0:24:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
